WEBVTT

00:17.110 --> 00:17.460
Here,

00:17.810 --> 00:19.010
have a bite of the bun.

00:19.020 --> 00:22.390
[Half a month ago]

00:19.460 --> 00:20.260
Never thought

00:20.460 --> 00:22.300
I'd take in a sidekick here.

00:22.820 --> 00:24.080
He's called Lyu Ruhui.

00:24.660 --> 00:25.990
He's really something.

00:26.140 --> 00:27.820
He masters some mystical tricks.

00:27.820 --> 00:28.950
The guy's quite tall

00:29.460 --> 00:30.320
and energetic,

00:30.870 --> 00:31.780
with thick eyebrows

00:31.780 --> 00:32.270
and big eyes.

00:32.270 --> 00:34.000
Blessing generations to come!

00:34.100 --> 00:36.830
He actually pulled off the trick of
Three Immortals Eating Noodles.

00:36.830 --> 00:38.090
I told him to follow me,

00:38.470 --> 00:39.430
and I'd have his back.

00:39.430 --> 00:41.060
Were it not for this young man,

00:41.060 --> 00:42.420
I would've died
on the Corpse Driving journey.

00:42.420 --> 00:43.320
I'm a human!

00:43.340 --> 00:45.430
Who would've thought those bastards
were smuggling opium?

00:45.430 --> 00:46.160
Opium paste?

00:46.750 --> 00:47.300
Also,

00:48.340 --> 00:50.570
he said he was going
to the Qian family's place.

00:50.570 --> 00:52.130
He said his name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

00:52.130 --> 00:53.730
My real name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

00:54.060 --> 00:55.860
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

02:38.020 --> 02:41.750
[A Prophet]

02:42.400 --> 02:44.730
[Episode 7]

02:46.520 --> 02:48.040
[Qianshan Station]

02:48.070 --> 02:49.790
[Seven days ago]

03:05.420 --> 03:07.080
It's indeed not enough for me.

03:21.660 --> 03:22.460
Spare me, sir!

03:22.510 --> 03:23.230
We're all

03:23.310 --> 03:24.510
in the same business.

03:32.579 --> 03:33.440
Second Master,

03:33.750 --> 03:35.210
someone is here to see you.

03:39.700 --> 03:41.100
You didn't expect this, did you?

03:41.100 --> 03:42.140
I'm still alive.

03:43.380 --> 03:44.260
Who are you?

03:44.860 --> 03:46.390
You threw me into the river,

03:46.540 --> 03:48.100
and you've already forgotten it?

03:48.100 --> 03:49.540
This guy is a fraud!

03:49.860 --> 03:51.070
He used my name

03:51.420 --> 03:52.700
to sneak into Longxuya

03:52.790 --> 03:54.260
and got Chief Du killed!

03:54.630 --> 03:56.430
You have nothing to back that up.

03:56.470 --> 03:57.820
Why should we believe you?

03:57.820 --> 03:59.540
When the incident happened at Longxuya,

03:59.540 --> 04:00.580
I saw him

04:00.980 --> 04:02.260
with Feng Siyuan.

04:02.910 --> 04:03.750
This guy

04:04.030 --> 04:05.260
used Feng Siyuan

04:05.420 --> 04:06.620
to wipe out Longxuya.

04:06.660 --> 04:08.720
He's now targeting your Qian family!

04:09.470 --> 04:10.750
Is what he said true?

04:10.860 --> 04:11.920
What are you doing?

04:12.140 --> 04:12.700
Second Brother!

04:12.700 --> 04:14.100
Was he telling the truth?

04:19.339 --> 04:20.019
Yes,

04:21.510 --> 04:22.970
I work for Commander Feng.

04:23.550 --> 04:25.610
Blind Du is a mere opium smuggler.

04:25.900 --> 04:26.950
The real source

04:26.950 --> 04:28.550
is the buyer pulling the strings—

04:28.550 --> 04:29.350
Mingcao Hall,

04:29.550 --> 04:30.310
the Qian family.

04:30.310 --> 04:32.460
What does the Qian family
have to do with this?

04:32.460 --> 04:34.820
On the surface, the Qian family
runs a herbal medicine business.

04:34.820 --> 04:35.630
But behind the scenes,

04:35.630 --> 04:37.580
they make the drugs
collected from Blind Du

04:37.580 --> 04:39.780
into an ointment called Bashen Powder,

04:40.340 --> 04:41.260
raking in money

04:41.670 --> 04:43.000
and harming the people.

04:43.310 --> 04:44.510
Your empty words

04:44.630 --> 04:45.960
are hardly convincing.

04:46.260 --> 04:48.120
All the Qian family's shady deeds

04:48.130 --> 04:49.930
are recorded in a secret ledger.

04:50.110 --> 04:51.700
If we can bring it to light,

04:52.340 --> 04:53.270
Commander Feng,

04:53.780 --> 04:55.590
you will be upholding justice for all.

04:55.590 --> 04:58.390
I've always engraved
Mr. Sun's saying in my heart—

05:01.950 --> 05:03.510
the world belongs to the public.

05:03.510 --> 05:05.140
If you can raid the Qian family,

05:05.140 --> 05:06.310
you'll rid the people

05:06.310 --> 05:08.380
of the threat of drugs
for the public good.

05:08.380 --> 05:09.440
You'll confiscate

05:09.460 --> 05:11.460
the illicit possessions and keep
the region safe, also for the public good.

05:11.460 --> 05:12.020
This is

05:12.460 --> 05:14.130
a good deal for the public good.

05:14.130 --> 05:15.080
I also keep

05:15.100 --> 05:17.030
Mr. Sun's saying in my heart—

05:17.780 --> 05:19.580
the world belongs to the public.

05:23.260 --> 05:25.260
"The world belongs to the public."
Nice.

05:25.260 --> 05:25.900
But

05:26.310 --> 05:27.950
I need to borrow something from you

05:27.950 --> 05:29.670
before I visit the Qian family this time.

05:29.670 --> 05:30.200
Go ahead.

05:31.510 --> 05:32.770
Why should I trust you?

05:32.900 --> 05:35.159
You can check the license plate out there

05:35.330 --> 05:36.670
and see if it's
from the division headquarters.

05:36.670 --> 05:37.940
What if it's a stolen one?

05:37.940 --> 05:40.400
And what if I really am
Commander Feng's man?

05:40.950 --> 05:42.610
Can you bear the consequences

05:42.830 --> 05:45.290
of offending the Commander, Second Master?

05:46.990 --> 05:47.720
Third Madam.

05:48.140 --> 05:48.870
Third Madam.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.870
A group of soldiers is at the door.

05:50.870 --> 05:53.470
The leader says they're here
to deliver a gift.

05:54.020 --> 05:55.550
The grand gift has arrived.

05:56.870 --> 05:57.580
Let him in.

05:57.750 --> 05:58.409
Yes, Ma'am.

06:16.180 --> 06:16.630
Sir,

06:17.020 --> 06:18.260
here is what you asked for.

06:18.260 --> 06:19.460
Commander Feng ordered me

06:19.460 --> 06:21.060
to hand it to you personally.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.250
Put it on the table.

06:22.820 --> 06:23.350
Yes, Sir.

06:36.580 --> 06:38.380
Second Master, won't you open it

06:38.460 --> 06:39.390
to see if you like

06:39.630 --> 06:40.630
the gift?

06:58.260 --> 06:59.390
Who exactly are you?

07:01.350 --> 07:03.460
Aren't you good at fortune-telling,
Second Master?

07:03.460 --> 07:04.700
You businessmen believe

07:04.700 --> 07:06.830
that investments must yield returns.

07:07.190 --> 07:09.050
We in the military have a rule too.

07:09.510 --> 07:11.510
Once a gun is drawn, it must be fired.

07:11.630 --> 07:12.490
Second Master,

07:13.620 --> 07:15.030
take aim.

07:28.550 --> 07:29.410
Mr. Chengming,

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
please calm down.

07:32.060 --> 07:33.110
I can't.

07:34.820 --> 07:35.900
He is right.

07:36.380 --> 07:38.580
I did wipe out the entire Longxuya Branch
for Commander Feng.

07:38.580 --> 07:39.550
Do you know why?

07:41.110 --> 07:42.140
Because those frauds

07:42.140 --> 07:44.600
used our soldiers' bodies
to smuggle opium.

07:45.870 --> 07:47.000
They were soldiers,

07:47.750 --> 07:49.680
brothers to Commander Feng and me.

07:51.110 --> 07:52.909
Not your tools for making money.

07:53.020 --> 07:54.310
What exactly is going on?

07:54.310 --> 07:54.670
I...

07:55.310 --> 07:56.220
I don't know.

07:56.380 --> 07:57.240
Second Master.

07:59.340 --> 08:01.940
If someone desecrated
your brothers' bodies,

08:02.110 --> 08:03.990
would you just let it go?

08:04.260 --> 08:05.120
Mr. Chengming,

08:05.260 --> 08:06.700
Mr. Chengming, please calm down.

08:06.700 --> 08:07.950
What soldiers?

08:08.110 --> 08:09.370
We really have no idea.

08:09.380 --> 08:10.310
If Blind Du

08:10.430 --> 08:12.190
really did such a heartless thing,

08:12.190 --> 08:13.520
then he deserved to die.

08:20.340 --> 08:22.140
Such a man who deserved to die

08:22.870 --> 08:24.870
was supposed to be executed in public.

08:24.870 --> 08:27.140
But he died the night
before the execution.

08:27.140 --> 08:28.870
Don't you think he got off easy?

08:29.700 --> 08:29.990
Then

08:30.750 --> 08:31.750
who did it?

08:36.030 --> 08:37.159
The Tianxiang Sect.

08:39.549 --> 08:40.740
You and Blind Du

08:41.030 --> 08:43.630
smuggled drugs behind
the Sect Master's back.

08:43.669 --> 08:44.600
Blind Du's death

08:45.390 --> 08:47.580
was the Sect Master
making an example of him.

08:47.580 --> 08:49.270
But if your Bashen Powder

08:49.270 --> 08:50.600
is escorted by our army,

08:50.980 --> 08:52.240
you won't have to worry

08:52.500 --> 08:54.390
about the Tianxiang Sect seeking revenge.

08:54.390 --> 08:55.910
After all, in these chaotic times,

08:55.910 --> 08:58.440
what is safer than
having the army's backing?

08:58.950 --> 08:59.670
Then

09:00.820 --> 09:01.820
how much does

09:02.620 --> 09:03.820
Commander Feng want?

09:06.500 --> 09:07.630
Commander Feng said

09:08.220 --> 09:10.350
he only wants 30 percent of the profit.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.820
What if I refuse?

09:19.580 --> 09:20.190
Second Master, why do you

09:20.190 --> 09:21.950
think your whole family is still

09:21.950 --> 09:22.880
living in peace?

09:23.390 --> 09:24.700
To show his sincerity,

09:25.070 --> 09:26.390
Commander Feng has told the Sect Master

09:26.390 --> 09:27.790
not to touch your family.

09:28.620 --> 09:30.270
Commander Feng also said

09:30.820 --> 09:32.790
that harmony brings wealth.

09:33.270 --> 09:34.500
Second Master, don't listen to him.

09:34.500 --> 09:35.660
He sent a severed head.

09:35.660 --> 09:38.120
What harmony and wealth
is he talking about?

09:41.830 --> 09:43.330
Amitabha.

09:57.220 --> 09:57.740
You...

10:04.220 --> 10:05.270
Mr. Chengming.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.190
If we can

10:09.580 --> 10:11.620
cooperate with Commander Feng this time,

10:11.620 --> 10:14.190
it will be a great blessing
for the Qian family.

10:14.190 --> 10:16.450
But this is a matter of great importance.

10:16.670 --> 10:19.600
Please allow my brother and me
to discuss it further.

10:21.070 --> 10:22.200
As for the business,

10:22.790 --> 10:23.920
I can afford to wait.

10:24.460 --> 10:25.430
I'm just afraid

10:26.220 --> 10:27.550
Commander Feng cannot.

10:27.910 --> 10:28.980
I apologize

10:29.150 --> 10:30.190
for the offense today.

10:30.190 --> 10:32.590
Please stay at our residence
for a few days.

10:33.310 --> 10:35.700
My second brother and sister-in-law
are getting married.

10:35.700 --> 10:36.580
If you don't mind,

10:36.580 --> 10:37.580
please join us for the wedding.

10:37.580 --> 10:40.390
It can also be considered a good omen

10:40.740 --> 10:42.220
for our future cooperation.

10:42.220 --> 10:44.950
So, Second Master,
your wedding is approaching.

10:45.580 --> 10:46.980
Then I thank you

10:47.850 --> 10:49.670
in advance for the wedding drink.

10:49.670 --> 10:50.390
Huaiyi.

10:51.030 --> 10:52.190
What happened?

10:52.500 --> 10:53.100
Shuyi.

10:53.580 --> 10:54.560
It's a mess in here.

10:54.560 --> 10:56.220
Let me have the servants clean it up.

10:56.220 --> 10:56.950
Listen to me.

10:57.190 --> 10:59.310
Don't be afraid of whatever you see later.

10:59.310 --> 11:00.100
I'm here.

11:04.050 --> 11:05.380
What exactly happened?

11:08.810 --> 11:10.070
How could this happen?

11:10.420 --> 11:11.870
This is so unlucky

11:12.670 --> 11:14.130
right before the wedding.

11:14.270 --> 11:14.980
Bear with it.

11:14.980 --> 11:16.440
There are outsiders here.

11:19.190 --> 11:20.910
Let me introduce her.

11:21.460 --> 11:22.340
This is

11:22.620 --> 11:24.340
the woman I'm about to marry,

11:24.860 --> 11:25.980
Jiang Shuyi.

11:26.790 --> 11:27.620
Chengming,

11:27.980 --> 11:29.030
I'm

11:29.500 --> 11:30.700
a reckless man.

11:31.500 --> 11:32.790
Don't take what just happened

11:32.790 --> 11:33.820
to heart.

11:34.550 --> 11:35.700
Just as you said,

11:36.100 --> 11:36.860
harmony

11:37.790 --> 11:39.220
brings wealth.

11:46.580 --> 11:47.390
Do you know

11:47.390 --> 11:49.500
Lyu Ruhui is from the Tianxiang Sect?

11:49.650 --> 11:52.650
How can I explain to
the Tianxiang Sect if you kill him?

11:52.860 --> 11:55.390
The Tianxiang Sect
has already killed Blind Du.

11:55.390 --> 11:56.070
We

11:56.740 --> 11:57.700
will be next.

11:57.950 --> 11:59.810
Our business of the Bashen Powder

12:00.150 --> 12:02.030
has already broken
the Sect Master's rules.

12:02.030 --> 12:03.860
Wouldn't it be a good thing

12:04.270 --> 12:05.740
to have Commander Feng as our backer?

12:05.740 --> 12:07.670
Besides, they only want 30% of the profit.

12:07.670 --> 12:09.860
Can't you figure out this deal,
Second Brother?

12:09.860 --> 12:11.990
Do you know what you're talking about?

12:12.340 --> 12:14.430
Am I the one who can't figure it out now?

12:14.430 --> 12:15.150
Feng has his eyes

12:15.150 --> 12:17.030
on our Bashen Powder now.

12:17.220 --> 12:19.550
So he eliminated Longxuya
on the surface first.

12:19.550 --> 12:20.580
Now he sent someone over

12:20.580 --> 12:22.910
to hypocritically talk about
cooperation with us.

12:22.910 --> 12:24.340
He said he wants 30%.

12:24.790 --> 12:25.460
30%

12:25.910 --> 12:27.710
wouldn't even be enough for him.

12:27.790 --> 12:29.980
The reason Feng hasn't touched
our family yet

12:29.980 --> 12:32.150
is that only we know how to make
the Bashen Powder.

12:32.150 --> 12:33.310
One day,

12:33.640 --> 12:35.190
when we are squeezed dry by Feng,

12:35.190 --> 12:36.740
our fate will be worse than Blind Du's.

12:36.740 --> 12:37.550
Huaiyi!

12:38.950 --> 12:40.580
You are destined to face a disaster

12:40.580 --> 12:41.700
this year.

12:42.220 --> 12:43.670
I practice every day

12:43.670 --> 12:45.600
just to ward off disasters for you.

12:48.550 --> 12:49.340
Huaiyi.

12:50.340 --> 12:52.310
I'm taking the blame for this killing

12:52.310 --> 12:53.950
for you today.

12:59.700 --> 13:00.500
Sister,

13:01.130 --> 13:04.150
I won't say anything about you
messing with these things

13:04.150 --> 13:05.430
usually,

13:05.740 --> 13:06.580
but now

13:06.740 --> 13:08.340
you're believing in the Buddha at home

13:08.340 --> 13:10.270
and worshipping masters outside.

13:11.460 --> 13:12.670
Let me tell you,

13:13.700 --> 13:15.700
they are all clay idols.

13:44.950 --> 13:46.010
Second Madam Qian.

13:46.910 --> 13:49.770
You weren't even going to
invite me to your wedding?

13:49.910 --> 13:51.440
Only relatives and friends

13:51.670 --> 13:53.070
will come to the wedding.

13:53.420 --> 13:55.780
I've only just met you, Mr. Chengming.

13:56.340 --> 13:57.580
Why would I have invited you?

13:57.580 --> 13:59.180
Whether you invite me or not,

13:59.270 --> 14:00.460
I'm already here.

14:00.910 --> 14:02.910
I just wonder whether this marriage

14:02.950 --> 14:04.460
is real or not.

14:06.910 --> 14:07.910
What if it's real,

14:08.700 --> 14:09.900
and what if it's fake?

14:10.100 --> 14:11.070
If it's real,

14:11.950 --> 14:14.030
I naturally have to prepare a big gift.

14:14.030 --> 14:15.100
If it's fake...

14:19.980 --> 14:21.790
Maybe I can help.

14:24.820 --> 14:26.310
Stay out of my business.

14:31.030 --> 14:31.740
Keep quiet.

14:34.700 --> 14:35.760
Second Madam Qian.

14:37.100 --> 14:37.900
I'm here.

14:50.530 --> 14:51.860
Is the road smooth?

14:56.670 --> 14:57.930
Everything is normal.

14:57.950 --> 14:59.080
The Sect Master said

14:59.220 --> 15:00.480
to close the net early.

15:00.750 --> 15:02.550
We must get the money as soon as possible.

15:02.550 --> 15:04.220
I'll act immediately when I find a chance.

15:04.220 --> 15:05.390
Then rest early.

15:20.790 --> 15:22.820
Isn't the Qian family
with the Tianxiang Sect?

15:22.820 --> 15:24.950
Would your own people attack your own?

15:25.220 --> 15:26.880
Cooperating with Feng Siyuan

15:27.390 --> 15:29.320
is like asking a tiger for its hide.

15:29.620 --> 15:31.480
I advise you not to play with fire.

15:33.070 --> 15:35.100
Shouldn't you give me an explanation

15:35.100 --> 15:36.980
for what happened back then?

15:46.310 --> 15:48.770
You wouldn't believe
whatever I say anyway.

15:51.910 --> 15:52.790
Do it.

15:54.270 --> 15:55.310
Mr. Chengming.

15:58.620 --> 15:59.430
Want to die?

16:00.950 --> 16:02.220
It's not that simple.

16:03.220 --> 16:04.340
Your life alone

16:05.460 --> 16:07.580
can't make up
for the lives of my whole family.

16:07.580 --> 16:08.430
I know.

16:09.340 --> 16:11.870
You're coming for
the entire Tianxiang Sect.

16:18.390 --> 16:19.950
He's just a fraud.

16:20.100 --> 16:22.740
He sneaked into Longxuya using my name

16:22.740 --> 16:24.070
and killed Chief Du.

16:24.070 --> 16:26.130
Now he's coming for your Qian family.

16:31.430 --> 16:32.820
Honey, was my snoring

16:32.820 --> 16:33.950
keeping you awake?

16:34.310 --> 16:35.310
Tomorrow,

16:35.740 --> 16:37.980
go to Commander Feng's
division headquarters.

16:37.980 --> 16:40.240
Check Shangguan Chengming's identity.

16:41.270 --> 16:42.740
Honey, rest assured.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.430
Shangguan Chengming has nothing to do

16:44.430 --> 16:45.830
with the Tianxiang Sect.

16:46.070 --> 16:47.460
He came here

16:47.460 --> 16:49.190
with Blind Du’s head.

16:55.700 --> 16:56.750
Understood, Honey.

16:56.750 --> 16:59.580
I'll send someone there
first thing tomorrow morning.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.340
Amitabha.

17:02.500 --> 17:03.980
Amitabha.

17:05.950 --> 17:06.869
Third Madam,

17:07.200 --> 17:09.589
you invited me
to this salvation ritual today,

17:09.589 --> 17:10.829
and I can see

17:11.020 --> 17:11.869
you have

17:11.869 --> 17:14.869
the compassion to deliver
all beings from suffering.

17:15.349 --> 17:17.079
You flatter me, Mr. Shangguan.

17:17.190 --> 17:19.190
I wonder if you and the Second Master

17:19.390 --> 17:22.390
have reached a decision
regarding this partnership?

17:23.290 --> 17:25.130
I am naturally willing

17:25.430 --> 17:27.020
to cooperate with Commander Feng.

17:27.020 --> 17:27.869
It's just that...

17:27.869 --> 17:28.870
Third Madam.

17:29.150 --> 17:31.550
Who exactly calls the shots
in your family?

17:31.780 --> 17:33.590
Buddhism or Taoism,

17:33.780 --> 17:35.190
you have to pick one.

17:37.930 --> 17:40.660
You don't seem like someone
who is easily swayed.

17:41.350 --> 17:43.150
If you think this deal is viable,

17:43.350 --> 17:46.080
hand over the account book
for the Bashen Powder.

17:46.260 --> 17:48.060
Once Commander Feng reviews it,

17:48.260 --> 17:49.260
we have

17:50.350 --> 17:51.430
a deal.

17:51.630 --> 17:52.630
The account book?

17:52.670 --> 17:54.110
Since we are working together,

17:54.110 --> 17:54.840
the accounts

17:55.220 --> 17:56.630
naturally must be clear.

18:24.630 --> 18:26.390
I follow the righteous decree

18:26.980 --> 18:28.300
to pacify the wandering souls.

18:28.300 --> 18:29.670
May all beings be sheltered

18:29.670 --> 18:30.980
and all creations receive grace.

18:30.980 --> 18:32.460
May each return to their true nature.

18:32.460 --> 18:33.720
Let compassion spread

18:34.020 --> 18:34.980
and bless the universe.

18:34.980 --> 18:36.350
Bestow boundless mercy.

18:36.350 --> 18:38.020
Obey my command at once!

19:13.430 --> 19:14.020
Break!

19:35.540 --> 19:36.110
Master.

19:37.830 --> 19:38.630
Master.

19:40.870 --> 19:42.270
Master, are you alright?

19:42.430 --> 19:43.630
-Master.
-It’s fine.

19:52.220 --> 19:53.260
I had already sent away

19:53.260 --> 19:55.190
Lyu Ruhui's vengeful spirit,

19:55.590 --> 19:56.390
but an unknown

19:56.740 --> 19:58.590
surge of evil aura

19:59.060 --> 20:00.460
trapped his spirit

20:01.460 --> 20:02.860
in the Qian family again.

20:02.980 --> 20:05.180
Where would our family get an evil aura?

20:05.260 --> 20:07.300
While fighting that evil aura,

20:07.500 --> 20:08.780
I vaguely saw

20:09.110 --> 20:12.060
it was formed by a book.

20:12.260 --> 20:13.590
If I am not mistaken,

20:13.950 --> 20:14.870
it should be

20:15.260 --> 20:16.430
Yama's

20:17.190 --> 20:18.630
Book of Life and Death.

20:19.020 --> 20:20.480
The Book of Life and Death?

20:20.670 --> 20:21.190
This...

20:21.670 --> 20:23.800
How could our family have such a thing?

20:23.870 --> 20:25.460
The records in that book

20:25.870 --> 20:28.830
concern the lives and deaths of many.

20:29.260 --> 20:31.110
But as to what exactly it is,

20:31.180 --> 20:33.300
I must trouble you to think carefully,

20:33.300 --> 20:34.780
Third Madam.

20:37.980 --> 20:38.700
Master.

20:39.740 --> 20:40.430
Then,

20:41.810 --> 20:43.010
is there any other way

20:43.570 --> 20:45.430
to appease this vengeful spirit?

20:45.740 --> 20:46.910
Lyu Ruhui

20:47.260 --> 20:50.660
is tightly bound by the evil aura
of the Book of Life and Death.

20:51.150 --> 20:52.980
He cannot leave.

20:53.590 --> 20:55.540
To completely resolve this,

20:55.700 --> 20:57.060
Third Madam,

20:57.220 --> 20:58.910
you must find this

20:58.940 --> 21:00.550
Book of Life and Death.

22:33.220 --> 22:34.870
Help!

22:35.260 --> 22:36.500
Stay away!

22:36.500 --> 22:37.740
Honey.

22:38.020 --> 22:39.540
It's me. It's me.

22:41.090 --> 22:41.870
What's wrong?

22:41.870 --> 22:42.460
Nothing.

22:42.460 --> 22:43.110
What?

22:43.260 --> 22:44.110
There's...

22:46.390 --> 22:47.630
There's nothing.

22:47.980 --> 22:49.150
What did you see?

22:49.540 --> 22:50.070
Nothing.

22:50.440 --> 22:52.570
Are you under too much stress lately?

22:54.070 --> 22:55.030
It's okay.

22:58.220 --> 23:00.870
It's okay.

23:01.460 --> 23:02.060
It's okay.

23:05.300 --> 23:05.870
Wenxin,

23:07.590 --> 23:08.460
tell me,

23:08.780 --> 23:10.700
could the Book of Life and Death

23:11.020 --> 23:12.500
Master Chang mentioned

23:13.870 --> 23:15.150
be the ledger

23:15.430 --> 23:17.260
in Huaiyi's hands?

23:17.590 --> 23:18.670
Why do you say that?

23:18.910 --> 23:20.430
Didn't the Master say

23:20.630 --> 23:22.120
every sum of money in that ledger

23:22.120 --> 23:24.990
represents a human life?

23:25.910 --> 23:27.970
Isn't that the Book of Life and Death?

23:28.980 --> 23:31.310
But the Bashen Powder
is all off the books.

23:31.390 --> 23:32.630
Our ledger only records

23:32.630 --> 23:33.460
our dealings

23:33.460 --> 23:35.460
with the Tianxiang Sect.

23:35.670 --> 23:37.350
Wouldn't it be a bad idea
to hand it over to someone else?

23:37.350 --> 23:37.880
Besides,

23:37.980 --> 23:38.980
knowing your second brother,

23:38.980 --> 23:40.330
he wouldn't give it to you anyway.

23:40.330 --> 23:42.790
Whether he gives it to me or not,
I have to try!

23:44.190 --> 23:44.990
Otherwise...

23:45.830 --> 23:47.500
Otherwise, our family may

23:47.740 --> 23:49.670
never make it through this ordeal.

23:50.830 --> 23:52.190
I'll figure something out.

23:52.190 --> 23:53.350
I'll figure something out.

23:53.350 --> 23:54.110
It's okay.

24:06.350 --> 24:06.980
Sir.

24:07.390 --> 24:08.720
She gets scared easily.

24:08.780 --> 24:10.310
I haven't even started yet.

24:23.220 --> 24:23.670
Here.

24:24.300 --> 24:25.020
It's hot.

24:27.150 --> 24:28.220
Here, Chengming.

24:28.780 --> 24:29.740
Try this.

24:30.060 --> 24:32.380
I had someone make
this duck soup just for you.

24:32.380 --> 24:33.870
That's very thoughtful of you, Wenxin.

24:33.870 --> 24:34.590
Don't mention it.

24:34.590 --> 24:35.430
Have a taste.

24:35.430 --> 24:35.960
Alright.

24:36.670 --> 24:39.270
The broth is made with foxnuts
and Job's tears.

24:39.300 --> 24:42.630
It nourishes Yin, reduces internal heat,
and replenishes your energy.

24:42.630 --> 24:43.630
See how it tastes.

24:44.670 --> 24:45.870
It tastes good.

24:55.870 --> 24:57.780
Wenxin, you didn't come today

24:58.500 --> 25:00.560
just to bring me a bowl of soup, right?

25:03.830 --> 25:04.590
Chengming,

25:04.870 --> 25:05.670
rest assured.

25:05.910 --> 25:07.150
I will do whatever it takes

25:07.150 --> 25:08.780
to get that ledger for you.

25:09.110 --> 25:10.150
Not everyone

25:10.630 --> 25:11.540
can see the situation

25:11.540 --> 25:12.980
as clearly as you do.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.350
If we can make this deal happen,

25:15.350 --> 25:16.060
you'll

25:16.390 --> 25:17.990
have earned the most credit.

25:18.150 --> 25:18.910
My friend,

25:19.870 --> 25:21.460
if I get this done,

25:21.910 --> 25:23.460
I have a favor to ask.

25:28.700 --> 25:29.260
Honey,

25:29.460 --> 25:30.830
I've asked around.

25:31.060 --> 25:34.390
Shangguan Chengming is indeed
Commander Feng's adjutant.

25:37.630 --> 25:39.460
The Master once told our family

25:39.460 --> 25:40.950
that we'd eventually face a great ordeal.

25:40.950 --> 25:42.740
He wrote this poem
while giving me guidance.

25:42.740 --> 25:43.940
Look at the last line.

25:44.150 --> 25:46.780
This character is
Commander Feng's surname, isn't it?

25:46.780 --> 25:48.460
"Finally meeting a worthy man"—

25:48.460 --> 25:50.390
doesn't that mean Commander Feng?

25:50.670 --> 25:52.220
It has to be Commander Feng.

25:55.430 --> 25:56.430
That makes sense.

26:01.060 --> 26:01.630
Huaiyi,

26:01.740 --> 26:02.980
before our wedding,

26:02.980 --> 26:04.870
I asked a married woman blessed
with good fortune to comb my hair.

26:04.870 --> 26:05.630
She told me

26:05.630 --> 26:06.950
to leave this comb here

26:06.950 --> 26:08.430
for a few days as an offering

26:08.430 --> 26:09.300
for good luck.

26:10.260 --> 26:10.740
Master.

26:10.950 --> 26:11.260
Madam.

26:11.260 --> 26:12.590
I've brought it for you.

26:18.700 --> 26:19.110
It...

26:19.910 --> 26:20.640
It's broken.

26:20.780 --> 26:21.980
It's okay. It's okay.

26:22.430 --> 26:23.500
Just leave it to me.

26:25.190 --> 26:27.150
The Red Phoenix Star shines over you both—

26:27.150 --> 26:28.410
great joy is on its way.

26:29.060 --> 26:29.590
Madam,

26:29.830 --> 26:30.950
your face is glowing like a peach blossom;

26:30.950 --> 26:32.350
you will bring your husband good fortune
and prosperity to the family.

26:32.350 --> 26:33.280
You are destined

26:38.060 --> 26:40.190
to turn misfortune into good fortune.

26:40.630 --> 26:41.630
Huaiyi, look.

26:42.390 --> 26:43.700
Didn't it just break?

26:45.910 --> 26:47.910
Turn misfortune into good fortune.

26:48.110 --> 26:49.240
What does that mean?

26:49.540 --> 26:51.220
You came for money,

26:51.590 --> 26:53.220
and you will leave for money.

26:54.700 --> 26:55.430
Benefactor,

26:55.830 --> 26:57.430
is your surname Qian—money?

26:58.830 --> 26:59.630
Then, Master,

26:59.910 --> 27:01.060
tell me,

27:01.740 --> 27:02.870
what is my surname?

27:03.260 --> 27:05.700
Half full, half empty.

27:06.390 --> 27:08.920
The water god Gonggong
does not cause a flood.

27:09.590 --> 27:10.190
Your

27:10.700 --> 27:12.100
surname is Jiang—river.

27:13.740 --> 27:15.220
Then what did you mean

27:16.220 --> 27:17.220
by the misfortune

27:17.700 --> 27:18.830
you just mentioned?

27:19.540 --> 27:21.870
Once you enter the military,
thousands will die.

27:21.870 --> 27:24.430
You hold snow with wet hands
and never make it home.

27:24.430 --> 27:25.910
Your current situation

27:26.020 --> 27:27.500
is like being trapped

27:27.500 --> 27:29.900
among thousands upon thousands of troops.

27:32.650 --> 27:33.450
Then, Master,

27:34.430 --> 27:35.830
is there anything I can do

27:36.460 --> 27:37.830
to avert it?

27:38.110 --> 27:38.830
I'm afraid

27:39.590 --> 27:42.220
you've recently meddled in a karmic matter
you shouldn't have.

27:42.220 --> 27:42.950
You'd better

27:42.980 --> 27:43.980
make plans early.

27:44.500 --> 27:45.220
That's

27:45.350 --> 27:46.780
all I can say.

27:47.430 --> 27:48.490
Thank you, Master.

27:53.190 --> 27:55.190
It's a good thing we came here today.

27:55.220 --> 27:56.780
We really need to watch our backs

27:56.780 --> 27:58.150
from now on.

27:58.540 --> 27:59.780
I think

28:00.190 --> 28:02.300
what he said makes some sense.

28:02.780 --> 28:05.500
We did offend Commander Feng recently.

28:05.980 --> 28:07.640
I just can't shake the feeling

28:07.910 --> 28:09.510
that something's not right.

28:10.020 --> 28:10.670
Huaiyi,

28:11.300 --> 28:12.670
don't you think

28:13.150 --> 28:15.060
we'd be better off keeping

28:15.390 --> 28:16.590
the money ourselves?

28:17.260 --> 28:18.260
What if

28:18.700 --> 28:20.150
we have children someday?

28:20.150 --> 28:22.480
We wouldn't want them to starve, would we?

28:24.630 --> 28:25.360
Don't worry.

28:25.870 --> 28:26.870
I'll take care of

28:27.300 --> 28:28.590
both you

28:29.300 --> 28:30.390
and our kids.

28:31.060 --> 28:31.920
Stop worrying.

28:47.260 --> 28:47.950
Chengming,

28:48.390 --> 28:49.830
if I get this done,

28:50.380 --> 28:51.860
I have a favor to ask.

28:52.350 --> 28:53.680
Please speak your mind.

28:53.870 --> 28:54.670
I'd like

28:55.590 --> 28:58.520
to serve under you,
if you could find me a position...

29:04.110 --> 29:04.640
Alright.

29:05.060 --> 29:05.990
You have my word.

29:06.050 --> 29:06.920
Thank you.

29:07.190 --> 29:08.150
If this deal

29:08.150 --> 29:09.910
really is thanks to you,

29:10.670 --> 29:11.430
from now on,

29:12.350 --> 29:13.220
you won't ever have to

29:13.220 --> 29:15.220
live by other people's whims again.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.280
What are you looking for?

29:56.300 --> 29:56.590
Huai...

29:56.590 --> 29:57.060
Huaiyi.

29:57.420 --> 29:58.820
What are you looking for?

29:59.010 --> 30:00.140
Tell me,

30:01.350 --> 30:02.750
and I'll help you find it.

30:13.830 --> 30:14.500
Huaiyi,

30:14.980 --> 30:16.430
what's all this

30:17.150 --> 30:18.190
commotion about?

30:21.630 --> 30:22.500
Chengming,

30:23.670 --> 30:24.870
please don't take offense.

30:24.870 --> 30:27.940
Since we'll be doing business
together from now on,

30:28.380 --> 30:30.780
I asked you to join us today
and see for yourself

30:30.780 --> 30:31.830
and learn about

30:32.260 --> 30:33.660
the rules our Qian family

30:33.830 --> 30:36.160
has passed down through the generations.

30:41.150 --> 30:41.780
Huaiyi.

30:42.260 --> 30:42.870
Honey.

30:49.460 --> 30:50.990
I asked everyone here today

30:51.060 --> 30:51.870
because

30:52.590 --> 30:53.740
there is a thief

30:53.950 --> 30:55.060
in the Qian family.

30:55.390 --> 30:56.430
I am not a thief.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.430
I am not a thief.

30:57.430 --> 30:58.630
If you are not a thief,

30:58.910 --> 31:00.300
what were you doing in my study?

31:00.300 --> 31:00.590
I...

31:00.780 --> 31:01.060
I...

31:01.260 --> 31:01.870
Were you trying to steal money?

31:01.870 --> 31:02.950
No,

31:02.950 --> 31:03.780
absolutely not.

31:03.780 --> 31:05.440
If it was not money, then what?

31:11.020 --> 31:11.670
Someone.

31:12.190 --> 31:14.050
Bring out the family punishment.

31:21.610 --> 31:22.350
Huaiyi,

31:22.910 --> 31:25.310
we haven't gotten
to the bottom of this yet.

31:25.430 --> 31:26.760
Don't do anything rash.

31:27.460 --> 31:28.060
Shuyi,

31:28.870 --> 31:29.590
sit down.

31:30.430 --> 31:31.690
A country has its laws,

31:31.740 --> 31:33.200
and a family has its rules.

31:34.020 --> 31:35.390
No matter who he is,

31:35.870 --> 31:36.980
he must

31:37.350 --> 31:38.740
conduct himself.

31:40.110 --> 31:40.540
Talk.

31:40.980 --> 31:42.710
What were you doing in my study?

32:15.260 --> 32:15.950
Wenxin,

32:16.780 --> 32:18.670
I'll give you one last chance.

32:19.390 --> 32:20.060
Talk.

32:21.500 --> 32:23.560
What exactly were you trying to steal

32:23.630 --> 32:24.950
from my study?

32:27.110 --> 32:28.780
Chengming is right.

32:29.110 --> 32:31.950
We have no choice but to cooperate
with Commander Feng now.

32:31.950 --> 32:34.680
It's only natural that he wants
to see the ledger.

32:35.500 --> 32:37.260
Why are you still hesitating?

32:39.670 --> 32:40.780
It seems

32:41.590 --> 32:43.870
someone is backing you up.

32:45.250 --> 32:47.350
You've even got the nerve
to talk to me like this.

32:47.350 --> 32:48.060
Huaijin.

32:49.670 --> 32:51.800
So this is the dog you've been raising.

32:54.950 --> 32:56.390
Careful, one day

32:56.460 --> 32:57.980
this ungrateful beast

32:58.260 --> 32:59.980
will bite you back.

33:24.020 --> 33:24.740
Honey.

34:17.060 --> 34:18.590
How could he be so ruthless?

34:19.540 --> 34:20.350
Wenxin,

34:21.710 --> 34:23.350
everyone was there.

34:23.659 --> 34:24.500
I had no choice

34:25.750 --> 34:27.500
but to hit you.

34:28.949 --> 34:29.460
Come on.

34:29.620 --> 34:30.580
Give it to me.

34:32.659 --> 34:34.540
I brought our ancestral wound medicine.

34:34.540 --> 34:35.830
Let me put some on.

34:44.389 --> 34:45.120
Does it hurt?

34:47.750 --> 34:48.710
Hang in there.

35:03.100 --> 35:04.060
Miss Shuyi,

35:04.390 --> 35:06.270
I've brought your bird's nest porridge.

35:06.270 --> 35:07.020
Come in.

35:17.950 --> 35:18.830
Enjoy.

35:23.310 --> 35:25.100
After Zhou Wenxin's scene,

35:25.350 --> 35:26.530
it seems Second Master has come around

35:26.530 --> 35:27.930
to depositing the money.

35:28.660 --> 35:30.260
The Sect Master wants to know

35:30.950 --> 35:32.950
when you're going to make your move.

35:35.750 --> 35:36.500
Today.

36:13.940 --> 36:15.140
Everything's ready?

36:16.700 --> 36:18.300
Why are you sweating so much?

36:20.500 --> 36:21.270
Huaiyi,

36:22.660 --> 36:24.580
are you sure you want to put
all this money

36:24.580 --> 36:25.710
in my name

36:26.100 --> 36:27.230
instead of leaving it with Huaijin?

36:27.230 --> 36:30.020
Huaijin and Zhou Wenxin
are clearly in on it together.

36:30.020 --> 36:31.790
I think they

36:32.180 --> 36:34.500
have fallen
for Shangguan Chengming's scheme.

36:34.500 --> 36:35.180
They're not

36:36.140 --> 36:38.180
the ones who get
to call the shots in this family.

36:38.180 --> 36:39.240
Actually, Huaijin

36:39.620 --> 36:41.080
must have her own reasons.

36:41.430 --> 36:42.150
Let's

36:42.180 --> 36:43.580
give her the ledger.

36:43.790 --> 36:45.790
That should make her feel better.

36:46.430 --> 36:48.140
We'd already had something
unpleasant happen that day.

36:48.140 --> 36:49.870
If you upset everyone again,

36:50.390 --> 36:52.180
how are we supposed to get married?

36:52.180 --> 36:53.100
I don't want to

36:53.260 --> 36:55.980
marry into your Qian family
with everyone at odds.

36:55.980 --> 36:57.710
Well, aren't you considerate?

36:57.710 --> 36:59.350
Honey. You're truly understanding

36:59.350 --> 37:00.150
and generous.

37:01.350 --> 37:02.430
It's just that

37:03.020 --> 37:04.020
my eldest brother

37:04.150 --> 37:05.830
has always kept the ledger.

37:06.140 --> 37:07.200
Speaking of which,

37:07.790 --> 37:10.350
I'm also the future daughter-in-law
of your Qian family.

37:10.350 --> 37:11.640
Should I go

37:11.910 --> 37:13.640
and visit your eldest brother?

37:13.980 --> 37:14.830
No need.

37:15.270 --> 37:16.350
My eldest brother is a bit eccentric

37:16.350 --> 37:17.790
and rarely sees anyone.

37:18.180 --> 37:19.350
You will naturally meet him

37:19.350 --> 37:20.410
on our wedding day.

37:52.580 --> 37:53.430
Hello, Miss.

37:53.710 --> 37:54.710
Can I deposit this amount here

37:54.710 --> 37:56.230
and withdraw it

37:56.390 --> 37:57.100
in Nanyang?

37:57.180 --> 37:58.230
As long as it's a Meifeng Bank branch,

37:58.230 --> 37:59.890
you can withdraw it anywhere.

38:01.540 --> 38:02.230
Sir,

38:02.540 --> 38:03.580
that's too large an amount

38:03.580 --> 38:04.580
for me to authorize.

38:04.580 --> 38:06.460
I'll need to call our bank manager.

38:06.460 --> 38:07.540
Can you call them now?

38:07.540 --> 38:08.340
I'm in a hurry.

38:09.540 --> 38:10.140
All right.

38:10.180 --> 38:10.910
Come with me.

38:14.540 --> 38:15.390
What are you doing?

38:15.390 --> 38:15.750
This way, please.

38:15.750 --> 38:17.060
Watch where you're going!

38:17.060 --> 38:18.140
Are you blind?

38:18.500 --> 38:19.620
That's enough, Huaiyi.

38:19.620 --> 38:20.940
He didn't do it on purpose.

38:20.940 --> 38:21.710
Don't be mad.

38:24.350 --> 38:25.210
I'm sorry, sir.

38:25.660 --> 38:26.790
Stupid.

38:31.270 --> 38:31.790
Hello.

38:31.910 --> 38:32.910
How can I help you?

38:33.060 --> 38:33.910
I want to deposit some money.

38:33.910 --> 38:34.420
Just a moment.

38:34.420 --> 38:35.730
Once I've counted the money,

38:35.730 --> 38:37.930
I'll give you the deposit certificate.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.560
[Women's bathroom]

39:00.410 --> 39:01.380
Okay, Manager.

39:03.540 --> 39:04.750
I'm sorry, sir.

39:04.780 --> 39:08.440
Our manager said the interest rate
you're asking for is a bit high.

39:10.910 --> 39:11.510
All right.

39:17.750 --> 39:18.610
How about this?

39:19.020 --> 39:20.620
I can settle for a lower interest rate,

39:20.620 --> 39:22.390
as long as I can make a fixed-term deposit
and withdraw it at maturity.

39:22.390 --> 39:23.320
Could you please

39:23.500 --> 39:24.830
talk to the manager again?

39:24.830 --> 39:25.390
Okay.

39:25.620 --> 39:26.460
Please have a seat.

39:26.460 --> 39:26.980
Okay.

39:31.390 --> 39:32.910
Can you hurry up?

39:51.270 --> 39:52.750
Sorry, Mr. Qian.

39:53.140 --> 39:54.270
Sorry to keep you waiting.

39:54.270 --> 39:55.460
Here's your deposit certificate.

39:55.460 --> 39:56.360
You can withdraw it
at any branch nationwide.

39:56.360 --> 39:57.590
Just sign here.

40:13.380 --> 40:14.640
Please keep this safe.

40:18.500 --> 40:19.100
Thank you.

40:19.150 --> 40:20.010
Have a good day.

40:26.180 --> 40:27.420
Let's go get that bag first.

40:27.420 --> 40:29.100
You also like that bracelet, right?

40:29.100 --> 40:29.620
No need, Huaiyi.

40:29.620 --> 40:30.500
Huaiyi, Shuyi.

40:33.390 --> 40:34.520
What a coincidence.

40:34.790 --> 40:37.060
What brings you to the bank in person?

40:41.100 --> 40:41.660
Come on.

40:41.830 --> 40:43.180
Stop beating around the bush.

40:43.180 --> 40:44.950
You're here to deposit money,
aren't you, Huaiyi?

40:44.950 --> 40:45.480
Huaijin,

40:45.870 --> 40:46.830
whatever it is,

40:47.460 --> 40:48.710
let's talk about it at home.

40:48.710 --> 40:49.570
Second Master,

40:49.710 --> 40:51.660
let me ask you something
on Commander Feng's behalf.

40:51.660 --> 40:53.730
Are you planning to transfer
the money and run?

40:53.730 --> 40:56.100
You say one thing to our faces
and do another behind our backs.

40:56.100 --> 40:57.350
Do you take me for a fool,

40:57.350 --> 40:59.660
or do you think Commander Feng
is someone you can push around?

40:59.660 --> 41:00.580
I think

41:01.350 --> 41:02.570
this is our family matter.

41:02.570 --> 41:04.970
I can't interfere
with your family matter.

41:05.360 --> 41:07.490
But if you choose to learn the hard way,

41:08.710 --> 41:10.830
when the Tiansang Sect comes knocking,

41:10.830 --> 41:11.620
I hope

41:12.620 --> 41:14.710
you'll still be this tough then.

41:15.660 --> 41:16.390
Huaiyi,

41:16.870 --> 41:17.800
Let's have a look

41:17.910 --> 41:19.510
at the deposit certificate.

41:41.540 --> 41:43.740
You deposited all the money
in her name?

41:44.950 --> 41:45.540
Huaijin,

41:45.790 --> 41:46.660
you misunderstood.

41:46.660 --> 41:48.500
Although the money is in my name,

41:48.710 --> 41:49.870
Huaiyi was going to give you

41:49.870 --> 41:51.500
this deposit certificate
when he got home.

41:51.500 --> 41:52.710
Without this deposit certificate,

41:52.710 --> 41:54.370
no one can withdraw the money.

41:57.020 --> 41:58.710
Since you trust me,

41:59.140 --> 41:59.980
I'll hold on

42:00.500 --> 42:02.500
to the deposit certificate for now.

42:08.980 --> 42:09.540
This one.

42:11.610 --> 42:12.650
Try them all.

42:13.100 --> 42:13.980
All of them?

42:14.460 --> 42:15.350
All of them.

42:15.420 --> 42:16.420
This way, please.

42:22.980 --> 42:23.940
Take your time.

42:29.310 --> 42:31.570
Mr. Qian, let's take your measurements.

42:32.500 --> 42:34.430
Let's measure your arm span first.

42:40.870 --> 42:41.490
Coming.

42:47.690 --> 42:49.020
Are you out of your mind?

42:56.000 --> 42:58.370
[In the next episode]

42:58.410 --> 42:59.280
Do you know

42:59.310 --> 43:00.600
where the Qian family's

43:00.600 --> 43:01.800
eldest master lives?

43:02.170 --> 43:03.540
Who are you?

43:04.170 --> 43:06.240
Who brought you here?

43:06.540 --> 43:07.990
I'm here to buy some medicine.

43:07.990 --> 43:10.260
You're here to buy medicine?

43:10.280 --> 43:11.410
Please go upstairs.

43:12.130 --> 43:13.790
Why didn't you light the lamp?

43:14.890 --> 43:17.290
There's something wrong with this candle.

43:17.710 --> 43:18.790
Wake up, bro.

43:20.550 --> 43:21.490
Eldest Master.

43:21.780 --> 43:23.110
Second Master and Second Madam

43:23.110 --> 43:24.550
asked me to bring you some wedding candy.
